  "translation": "Gomme bjale, laela gore ba rulaganye go rama nna dikedaraka go tšwa Lebhanone, gomme bahanka ba ka ba tla ba le bahanka ba gago; gomme moputšo wa bahanka ba gago ke tla go o nea, go ya ka tšohle seo o se bolelago; ka gobane wena o tseba gore ga go na motho gare ga rena yo a tsebago go rama dikgong bjalo ka ba Tsidone.",
